Approach

Initialize maxWords to 0.

Traverse each sentence using an enhanced for loop.

Split each sentence using a single space (" ").

Count the words using .length.

Update maxWords if the current sentence contains more words.

Return maxWords after checking all sentences.







class Solution {
    public int mostWordsFound(String[] sentences) {
        int maxWords = 0;

        for (String sentence : sentences) {
            int words = sentence.split(" ").length;
            maxWords = Math.max(maxWords, words);
        }

        return maxWords;
    }
}
